{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有。S05只有18秒，X同时呈现多句叙事和大量感受，扫读压力明显高于Y，部分感受也有堆叠之嫌。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"平\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X用关键词加亮和话、感受交替的顺序，让观众更容易抓住每段心理变化的核心，也更容易理解从害怕暴露、得到回应、渴望靠近到接受不确定性的因果过程。感受按音乐时点出现，能把情绪转折和具体的声音、身体体验联系起来，前后呼应也更充分。Y更轻省、叙事连贯，但右侧感受较多是并列罗列，与心理转折及音乐具体段落的对应不如X紧密。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "636f5597-0eca-487b-9db7-8e85d937c5a1", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261108T000807378745Z", "elapsed_seconds": 98.797, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T00:09:46.189224+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "093d931f85a18ce0d6d1b5335cdb3d95c2edcc3513fbf97422bfcde78b970784", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa238850